{{Illusionnotes
| name = One Man Army
| desc = Bestows this ability.<br><br>However, the ability does not grant the created [[illusions]] {{M|strength}} bonus because they cannot utilize {{M|bonus armor}} by design.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Aura}}
** Checks for nearby allied heroes in {{#var:One Man Army basic1}}-second intervals.
** The temporary bonus {{M|strength}} adapts immediately and is lost over its linger duration.
** Considers allied {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, and {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*** The following allied heroes disable the [[aura]]:
**** {{M|Hidden}} heroes.
**** {{M|Invulnerable}} heroes.
** {{Symbol|a|down}}
*** The ability values reduce per {{M|server tick}} linearly to nil throughout the aura linger duration.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:One Man Army icon0}}
| desc = Axe gains Strength based on 50% of his Armor as long as there are no allied heroes within 700 distance from Axe.  The effect fades over 3s after approaching an ally.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Does not consider the following units as allied heroes:
*** Axe-based {{M|clones}}.
*** {{M|Illusions}} owned by Axe.

