{{Splreflectnotes
| name = Battle Hunger
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus shd}} The passive {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|[[Battle Hunger|axe_battle_hunger]]}} application via {{A|Axe|Berserker's Call}} does not proc [[Spell Reflection]] sources.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|axe_battle_hunger}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** All ability components consider {{M|clones}} as heroes; {{M|creep-heroes}} and {{M|illusions}} as creeps.
** The debuff applied has three main components:
*** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|21px|1]] {{Symbol|a|Down}} {{Symbol|Move Speed}}
**** Disables the offensive [[movement speed]] slow component in the following conditions:
***** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} [[File:Dota2 Affects (90 Deg) icon.png|90°|21px]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|l}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
****** As long as the affected enemy is not within {{#var:Battle Hunger value3}} in front of Axe's current {{M|facing angle}} as visualized above.
****** Affects the following units:
******* {{M|Fogged units}}.
***** {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||movement speed slow increasing|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t2r}} does not update the current debuff instances.
*** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|21px|2]] {{Symbol|Dispel|Any}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}}
**** Has the following debuff [[dispel]] properties:
***** Can be dispelled by killing any unit, including {{M|denies}}, except {{M|illusions}}.
***** The affected enemy has to be credited for the last hit, excluding the enemy's {{M|summons|text=player-controlled units}}, including {{M|illusions}}.
*** [[File:Dota2 Condition-3.png|21px|3]] {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration and adapts the ability values correspondingly.
***** {{cf|shdnotes}} This restriction is removed upon acquiring the {{M|Aghanim's Shard|text=ability upgrade}}, and enables the debuff applied to be stackable per application. 
***** {{Symbol|Modifier|Stack}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}}
****** Reapplying the debuff now applies an independent debuff.

* {{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|axe_battle_hunger_self_movespeed}}
** {{cf|talnotes}} Grants bonus {{M|movement speed}} correspondingly to the amount of active debuff applied.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Battle Hunger icon0}}
| desc = Enrages an enemy unit, causing it to take damage over time until it kills another unit or the duration ends. The enemy is slowed as long as they are facing away from Axe.
}}
<hr>
* {{cf|talnotes}} The self {{ValueColor||movement speed bonus per enemy debuff|10tal}} {{M|talent|t=t1l}} grants Axe a buff that keeps track of debuff-affected enemy units at all times.
** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*** The buff is hidden when no debuffs are applied.

